& [Checkpoints] are mandatory
  + [authority_checkpoint] every processed SJS stage is path, section, and hash bound before code
  + [implementation_checkpoint] only authorized files change and Cargo, lockfile, unsafe, platform-call, and effect deltas remain zero
  + [behavior_checkpoint] exact SHA-256 vectors, partition equivalence, resource gates, observation nonforgeability, and stability revalidation are proven
