& [StopRules] are fail closed
  + stop on source, manifest, architecture, prerequisite signature, or artifact-binding mismatch
  + stop if successful observation is externally constructible or deserializable
  + stop if a failed chunk transition returns reusable accumulator state
  + stop if counters are changed after hash mutation or without checked arithmetic
  + stop if binding can accept a StablePair without current reconciliation
  + stop if structural agreement is described as physical byte origin or content stability
  + stop on new dependency, lockfile, unsafe, platform, filesystem, process, environment, clock, random, network, model, persistence, traversal, Git, receipt, admission, mutation, seal, cleanup, or promotion behavior

